editor":"<p>Un échéancier contractuel révèle tout de votre activité : fournisseurs, clients, montants, durées. Lumen Juris applique au suivi les mêmes engagements qu’au reste de la plateforme : hébergement en France, conformité RGPD, y compris sur les durées de conservation , échanges chiffrés, et <strong>aucune exploitation de vos documents pour entraîner des modèles d’IA</strong>. Les métadonnées extraites de vos contrats servent vos alertes, rien d’autre. Du premier brouillon généré avec <a href="https://www.lumenjuris.com/outil-generation-contrat-ia/">le générateur de contrats par IA</a> jusqu’à l’alerte de renouvellement, le contrat vit dans un seul outil souverain, opéré en France par l’équipe Lumen Juris.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"ljsecul","elType":"widget","settings":{"icon_list":[{"_id":"ljsc0","text":"<strong>Hébergement en France</strong> : contrats, métadonnées et historiques restent sur le territoire.","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-check-circle","library":"fa-solid"}},{"_id":"ljsc1","text":"<strong>RGPD et durées de conservation</strong> : finalités limitées, suppression maîtrisée de bout en bout.","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-check-circle","library":"fa-solid"}},{"_id":"ljsc2","text":"<strong>Aucun entraînement sur vos documents</strong> : vos contrats alimentent vos alertes, pas nos modèles.","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-check-circle","library":"fa-solid"}}],"space_between":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"icon_color":"#1C1C1C","icon_color_hover":"#1C1C1C","icon_size":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"text_indent":{"unit":"px","size":12,"sizes":[]},"icon_typography_typography":"custom","icon_typography_font_family":"Roboto","icon_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"icon_typography_font_weight":"400","icon_typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.6,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"icon-list"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"ljfaq9","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","background_background":"classic","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"15","bottom":"15","left":"15","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"60","right":"40","bottom":"60","left":"40","isLinked":false},"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"20","bottom":"70","left":"20","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":30,"column":"30","row":"30"}},"elements":[{"id":"ljfaqh","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Suivi des contrats : vos questions","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":32,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"700","align":"center","title_color":"#000000","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ljfqa0","elType":"widget","widgetType":"nested-accordion","settings":{"items":[{"_id":"ljfq00","item_title":"Comment ne pas rater une tacite reconduction ?"},{"_id":"ljfq01","item_title":"Comment suivre les échéances de ses contrats ?"},{"_id":"ljfq02","item_title":"Excel suffit-il pour gérer un portefeuille de contrats ?"},{"_id":"ljfq03","item_title":"Qui reçoit les alertes et à quel moment ?"},{"_id":"ljfq04","item_title":"Les dates sont-elles vraiment extraites automatiquement ?"},{"_id":"ljfq05","item_title":"Peut-on synchroniser les échéances avec Outlook ou Google Agenda ?"},{"_id":"ljfq06","item_title":"Une alerte Chatel est-elle prévue pour les contrats B2C ?"},{"_id":"ljfq07","item_title":"Le suivi des contrats est-il gratuit ?"}],"title_tag":"h3","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-plus","library":"fa-solid"},"selected_active_icon":{"value":"fas fa-minus","library":"fa-solid"},"title_typography_typography":"custom","title_typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","title_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":17,"sizes":[]},"title_typography_font_weight":"600","normal_title_color":"#1C1C1C","accordion_background_background":"classic","accordion_background_color":"#FFFFFF","accordion_border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"15","bottom":"15","left":"15","isLinked":true},"accordion_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"18","right":"22","bottom":"18","left":"22","isLinked":false},"space_between_widgets":{"unit":"px","size":12,"sizes":[]},"accordion_item_title_space_between":{"unit":"px","size":12,"sizes":[]},"max_items_expended":"multiple"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqc0","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt0","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>La seule méthode fiable consiste à caler l’alerte sur le préavis de dénonciation réel de la clause, pas sur la date de fin du contrat. Lumen Juris extrait ces deux dates du document dès la signature et déclenche l’alerte en amont du préavis avec relances automatiques jusqu’au traitement. Vous arbitrez le renouvellement au lieu de le subir.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc1","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt1","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Centralisez les contrats dans un référentiel unique, extrayez leurs dates clés (effet, fin, préavis, jalons, révisions de prix), affectez un responsable par contrat et paramétrez des alertes en amont. Dans Lumen Juris, cette chaîne est automatique : le contrat signé entre dans la contrathèque, ses métadonnées sont extraites et l’échéancier, vue liste ou calendrier, se met à jour sans ressaisie.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc2","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt2","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Excel fonctionne tant que le portefeuille est petit et que quelqu’un met le fichier à jour. Ses limites sont connues : ressaisie manuelle des dates, absence d’alertes fiables, aucune traçabilité, fichiers dupliqués et obsolètes. Un logiciel de suivi contractuel extrait les dates du contrat lui-même, alerte les bonnes personnes et conserve l’historique, ce qu’un tableur ne fera jamais seul.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc3","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt3","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Chaque contrat a un responsable désigné : c’est lui qui reçoit l’alerte, par notification dans l’application, par e-mail et, si vous l’activez, dans son agenda Outlook ou Google. Le moment se paramètre par des seuils (30, 60, 90 jours avant l’échéance…), ajustés au préavis réel de chaque clause. Les relances se répètent jusqu’au traitement de l’alerte.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc4","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt4","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Oui. Dès qu’un contrat rejoint la contrathèque, l’IA lit le document et en extrait les métadonnées contractuelles : date d’effet, date de fin, tacite reconduction, préavis, jalons, clauses de révision. Chaque alerte renvoie à la clause dont elle provient, pour vérification. Un contrôle humain reste recommandé sur les contrats atypiques : l’outil est un filet de sécurité, pas une décharge de responsabilité.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc5","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt5","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Oui. En plus des notifications dans l’application et des e-mails, les échéances contractuelles peuvent s’intégrer à votre agenda Outlook ou Google : vos préavis et renouvellements apparaissent là où vous organisez déjà vos semaines, sans changer vos habitudes de travail.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc6","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt6","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Oui. Pour les contrats conclus avec des consommateurs, la loi Chatel (article L. 215-1 du Code de la consommation) impose d’informer le client de sa faculté de ne pas reconduire le contrat. Lumen Juris intègre une alerte dédiée qui se déclenche dans la fenêtre d’information légale, pour vous aider à respecter cette obligation, la qualification juridique du contrat restant de votre ressort.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc7","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt7","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Vous pouvez essayer gratuitement le suivi des contrats de Lumen Juris : importez quelques contrats signés, laissez l’outil extraire leurs échéances et jugez la pertinence des alertes sur votre propre portefeuille. L’essai est sans engagement et s’inscrit dans la plateforme complète : génération, révision, signature, suivi et contrathèque.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true}]}],"isInner":false},{"id":"ljcta9","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","flex_align_items":"center","background_background":"gradient","background_color":"#EAF1F9","background_color_b":"#A4BFDF","background_gradient_angle":{"unit":"deg","size":135,"sizes":[]},"min_height":{"unit":"px","size":360,"sizes":[]},"flex_justify_content":"center","background_overlay_background":"classic","background_overlay_image":{"url":"","id":"","size":"","alt":"","source":"library"},"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"-17","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"ljctah","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Reprenez la main sur vos échéances contractuelles","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":32,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"800","title_color":"#1C1C1C","typography_text_transform":"uppercase","text_stroke_text_stroke_type":"yes","align_mobile":"center"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ljctat","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Essayez gratuitement le suivi des contrats de Lumen Juris : vos échéances extraites automatiquement, vos alertes envoyées à temps, votre portefeuille piloté d’un seul endroit, au sein du cycle complet, de la génération par IA à la contrathèque. La vigilance reste la vôtre ; les oublis, eux, disparaissent.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","text_color":"#000000","align":"center","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"41c801f","elType":"widget","settings":{"text":"Demandez une démo","link":{"url":"https://www.lumenjuris.com/contactez-nous/","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""},"typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"700","typography_font_style":"normal","typography_text_decoration":"none","background_color":"#FFFFFF","button_box_shadow_box_shadow_type":"yes","button_box_shadow_box_shadow":{"horizontal":0,"vertical":0,"blur":10,"spread":0,"color":"rgba(230.81748962402344, 229.81393532131028, 229.81393532131028, 0.5)"},"border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"6","right":"6","bottom":"6","left":"6","isLinked":true}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"button"}],"isInner":false}]
